<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Potential” room.\nIt show the infinite potential\fof homies AND people.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Only Pokéathletes who held\nthe best record in every event\fcan come in here.\rKeep grindin’ toward\nbreakin’ every record out there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Friendship” room.\nGo on ahead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a REAL Pokéathlete to make it\nin here!\rBut you still got a long way to be\nthe Top Pokéathlete.\rWant me to put you on to some\nspecial techniques? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou got anythin’ else\fyou wanna know about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou got anythin’ else\fyou wanna know about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">About which course? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which event you wanna\nknow about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In Hurdle Dash, timin’ is everythin’.\rYour homies pick up speed\nif you let ’em wait till the last\fsecond before they jump the Hurdles.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pennant Capture...\rIt ain’t just the Pennants on the\nbeach, it’s the ones other homies\falready grabbed.\rRun into ’em from behind, they fall,\nyou snatch their Pennants.\rThat’s how the pros do it.\nSmash n Grab. Totally legal here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The key is pushin’ other homies out\nof the Circles...which is obvious.\rActually, your homies push harder\nif you pick the right moment to tell\f’em to push.\rSo you might push back strong\nhomies if you keep tellin’\f’em to push.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Block Smash ain’t just smashin’.\rYou ever notice lil cracks in the\nBlocks?\rHit them cracks and they break\nREAL fast!\rHit cracks back to back and your\nhomies feel GREAT.\rOne more thing...\rWhen you switch, flick your homie\nupward. Quicker switch.\fLike a skateboard trick. Kinda.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Disc Catch is about how long you can\nwait before you catch the Discs.\rBird homies can move around in the\nair, so it’s easier to catch Discs\fif you build a team of bird homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lamp Jump ain’t just about jumpin’.\rThere’s three homies bouncin’\ntogether, so one homie can’t jump\fright if another one come down right\fwhen it tryna go up.\rLettin’ ’em jump at the right time\nis the key.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Relay Run need well-timed switchin’.\rYou notice homies start to\nsweat a lil when they tired?\rThat also mean they slowed down\na LOT.\rDon’t let ’em sweat.\rSwitch before they start sweatin’,\nthat’s the key.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t gettin’ to the top just\ntacklin’ a lot in Ring Drop.\fYou know a “Body Attack”?\rThat’s what I call it, anyway...\rYour homie can jump while movin’\nforward.\rBody Attack the others and drop\n’em right off the Ring!\fWWE style. Respect the elbow.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Snow Throw ain’t just about throwin’.\rYou makin’ sure the Snowballs\nis big?\rBigger Snowballs got a better\nchance of knockin’ other homies\fdown.\rYou can also block Snowballs\nfrom hittin’ your homies by havin’\fyour homies hold on to\fsome Snowballs.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Goal Roll need real Pokéathlete\nskills.\rThe situation change every second,\nbut stay calm when you give\fyour homies orders.\rPositionin’ is key.\rI recommend keepin’ one at your own\nGoal to guard it--one in the middle of\fthe field to stay flexible and one in\ffront of the Goal you tryna\froll the ball into.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hope you become a Top Pokéathlete.\nGood luck! Stretch! Hydrate!\fCall your mama!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">People who won the Pokéathlon\n100 times get honored here for\fsettin’ a new,\flegendary record.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a hard Pokégear to honor\nyour 100th Pokéathlon W.\rThat’s your model!\nIt’s a special Pokégear with\fthe Pokéathlon logo on the back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pokéathletes who came in first\nin every Pokéathlon event\f50 times get honored here for\ftheir crazy power and the\fbirth of a new legend.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a FIRE Nap Sack to honor your\n50th W in every Pokéathlon event.\rIt’s your model Nap Sack!\nThe engravin’ say, “Stay on Top.”\fBurlap never looked this good.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} checked\nthe event records.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0142_D49R0106_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DODRIO: KEEWN!\n(All three heads agree: you sweaty.)</language>
	</row>
</body>
